## 3. Store Listing Assets Preparation

Prepare these graphical and textual assets before creating the store listing:

| Asset | Specifications | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **App Icon** | 512 x 512 px, 32-bit PNG, max 1024 KB, no alpha/transparency | Play Store icon |
| **Feature Graphic** | 1024 x 500 px, JPG or 24-bit PNG, max 15 MB | Top banner on store listing |
| **Phone Screenshots** | Min 2 (recommended 4–6), 16:9 or 9:16 aspect ratio (e.g. 1080 x 2400 px), PNG or JPEG | Displays wallet screens (Dashboard, Send, Swap, Buckets, Transactions) |
| **App Title** | Up to 30 characters: `ICPay — Web3 ICP Wallet` | Main app title |
| **Short Description** | Up to 80 characters: `Secure, fast custodial ICP wallet with custom handles, swap, and on-chain storage.` | Search snippet |
| **Full Description** | Up to 4,000 characters: Detailed breakdown of features, security, zero gas fees, Internet Identity auth. | Full store text |

