## 5. Google Play Console Configuration Walkthrough

1. Open [Google Play Console](https://play.google.com/console).
2. Click **Create app**:
   - **App name**: `ICPay: ICP Crypto Wallet`
   - **Default language**: English (United States)
   - **App or game**: App
   - **Free or paid**: Free
   - Accept Declarations and click **Create app**.

3. **Complete the "Set up your app" dashboard checklist**:
   - **Privacy Policy**: Provide `https://icpay.app/privacy`.
   - **App Access**: Choose *All or some functionality is restricted* and provide demo instructions (e.g. "User signs in with Internet Identity. If testing without II, use the provided demo test credentials/keys").
   - **Ads**: Select *No, my app does not contain ads*.
   - **Content Ratings**: Complete the IARC questionnaire (Utility / Financial / Blockchain). Usually rates PEGI 3 / Everyone.
   - **Target Audience**: Select **18 and older**.
   - **Financial Features**: Check *Cryptocurrency or virtual currency wallet*. Confirm regulatory and fraud compliance statements.
   - **Data Safety**: Complete the questionnaire matching your privacy disclosures.
   - **Government Apps**: No.
   - **Financial Features Declaration**: Declare custodial wallet services for the Internet Computer ecosystem.

4. **Set Up Store Presence**:
   - Go to **Grow > Store presence > Main store listing**.
   - Paste **Short Description** and **Full Description**.
   - Upload **App Icon (512x512)** and **Feature Graphic (1024x500)**.
   - Upload **Phone Screenshots (min 4 recommended)**.

